  "worked_solution": "The matrix $U$ in the LU decomposition is obtained from the original matrix $A$ by row-reducing using Gaussian elementation. In particular, to make zeros below the main diagonal, we proceed as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A & =[\\begin{aligned}3 & 7 & -1 \\\\ 3 & -3 & 6 \\\\ 3 & 7 & -4\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}+(-1){R}_{1} \\\\  & \u223c[\\begin{aligned}3 & 7 & -1 \\\\ 0 & -10 & 7 \\\\ 3 & 7 & -4\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{3} & :={R}_{3}+(-1){R}_{1} \\\\  & \u223c[\\begin{aligned}3 & 7 & -1 \\\\ 0 & -10 & 7 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -3\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, ${u}_{33}=-3.$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
